    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "ねらった　エモノは　こっそり マーキング。　においを　たどって ゆだん　したころ　ぬすみに　くるぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il marque sa victime pour la suivre à l’odeur. Sitôt qu’elle est distraite, il s’empresse de lui voler ses biens.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "狙った　獲物は　こっそり マーキング。　においを　辿って 油断　したころ　盗みに　来るぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "みがるな　からだと　するどい　ツメで エサや　タマゴを　ぬすんで　まわる。 パルスワンが　てんてき。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Grâce à son corps leste et ses griffes acérées, il va et vient en dérobant Œufs et nourriture. Son ennemi juré est Fulgudog.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "With a lithe body and sharp claws, it goes around stealing food and eggs. Boltund is its natural enemy.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "身軽な　体と　鋭い　ツメで エサや　タマゴを　盗んで　まわる。 パルスワンが　天敵。",
        "language": {
